{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL090aGVyc19MYW5ndWFnZS9PdGhlci1MYW5ndWFnZS9UaGUlMjBBc3Nhc3NpbiUyME5leHQlMjBEb29yJTIwJTI4MjAwOSUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"The Assassin Next Door","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/EWG78UUowHBMOsDXvDtHol07N3.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eztduq6HLq1PMAdJKy7SH9VWotZ.jpg","description":"In an old apartment building on the wrong side of the tracks, two women, unknown to each other, live across the hall on the second floor. Galia is an assassin involved against her will with the local sex-traffic mafia. All she wants is to reunite with her little daughter that she left back home in Ukraine . Eleanor is a grocery store cashier and a battered wife. She dreams of winning the lottery and running away from her abusive husband. Galia and Eleanor don't know each other, but as neighbors they share two things: an adjoining wall and a strong need to plan their escape. As Galia disobeys her latest contract, a woman target, and Eleanor discovers that she's pregnant, the two women decide to take action against their oppressors in a fight for survival and freedom.\n\nRated R · Released 3 Dec 2009 · France, United States of America · 102 min\nStudio: Bleiberg Entertainment, Moving Pictures, DPI, Douek Productions","releaseInfo":"2009","genres":["Drama","Thriller","Action","Crime","Others"],"imdbRating":"5.5","runtime":"102 min","cast":["Olga Kurylenko","Ninet Tayeb","Vladimir Friedman","Zohar Shtrauss","Liron Levo","Shalom Michaelshvili","Henry David","Ester Rada"],"director":["Danny Lerner"],"released":"2009-12-03T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Beware of thy neighbor.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Danny Lerner","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/eWWaGlff96yd7L1lNQmkiWyrToV.jpg"},{"name":"Olga Kurylenko","character":"Galia","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ei6eYUhQFw2AaV6U5fyPptBaPF0.jpg"},{"name":"Ninet Tayeb","character":"Elinor","photo":"https://image.tmd